  "id": "equivalence",
  "term": "equivalence",
  "definition": "In this learning context, equivalence is a learned link between different stimuli because they lead to the same outcome or consequence. Once this shared relationship is learned, a person can group those stimuli together and use that similarity to remember old associations and extend them to new ones.",
